From: Ahmed Adel Wafdy <fandes99@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] fix(autoware_trajectory_modifier): include the boost::hash header

boost::hash is declared in boost/container_hash/hash.hpp. Boost.Uuid 1.86
stopped including it from uuid_hash.hpp, so "hash is not a member of
boost". boost/functional/hash.hpp forwards to it in every Boost release.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/autowarefoundation/autoware_universe/commit/9bd42c582e892f238d2ffba8568637c3cb87cf61]
Signed-off-by: Ahmed Adel Wafdy <fandes99@gmail.com>
---
 .../trajectory_modifier_utils/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp            | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/autoware/trajectory_modifier/trajectory_modifier_utils/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp b/include/autoware/trajectory_modifier/trajectory_modifier_utils/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp
index 3a58ebd148..fd9ef4adee 100644
--- a/include/autoware/trajectory_modifier/trajectory_modifier_utils/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp
+++ b/include/autoware/trajectory_modifier/trajectory_modifier_utils/obstacle_stop_utils.hpp
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 #include <autoware_planning_msgs/msg/trajectory_point.hpp>
 #include <sensor_msgs/msg/point_cloud2.hpp>
 
+#include <boost/functional/hash.hpp>
 #include <boost/uuid/uuid.hpp>
 #include <boost/uuid/uuid_generators.hpp>
 #include <boost/uuid/uuid_hash.hpp>
